              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="8">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">1ee787a1-aee2-51dd-b2ad-77166daed779</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Description</item>
                    <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Purpose: Time-averaged pedestrian wind around buildings from lattice-Boltzmann LES.
Fidelity: Engineering - OpenLB D3Q19 with Smagorinsky LES, not validated for this site.
Method: LBM Case with LBM Run Settings: 6 m grid, GPU on, inflow jitter on; runtime tries Podman, then Docker, then native.
Result: The time-averaged pedestrian-level wind field in a Vector Field Viewer beside the domain wireframe.
Needs: Eddy3D Setup &gt; LBM CFD (OpenLB); the GPU build needs NVIDIA. Runtime: minutes to hours.
Edit: Geometry; Grid Spacing (halving it costs 8x the memory and about 16x the time).</item>
                  </items>
