                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Optional roof hints per footprint, aligned with Footprints (LiDAR Site's Roof Hints): 'gable;4;90;across' — shape (flat/gable/hip/shed or an OSM roof:shape word); roof height m; ridge direction °; 'across' for the ridge on the short side. A hint is used only where the LiDAR has too few roof points to fit a roof; a fit always wins, and a fit that disagrees with its hint is counted in the Report.</item>
